(2515434, 347547, 22011, '<td valign="top">Ilike this, but can''t help thinking that cropping it from the top and right sides a bit would make it better..  You''ve framed the sun with the two trees, and the darker clouds, but there is too much sky above for my liking, and the sun is a bit near the center.<br/> <br/>Good work, and great to see a dark ''ansel-ish'' landscape on DPC in a general challenge.  Nice technique.</td>', 'Ilike this, but can''t help thinking that cropping it from the top and right sides a bit would make it better..  You''ve framed the sun with the two trees, and the darker clouds, but there is too much sky above for my liking, and the sun is a bit near the center. Good work, and great to see a dark ''ansel-ish'' landscape on DPC in a general challenge.  Nice technique.', '2006-06-14 06:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
