(2517241, 347594, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the foreground, with the tilt, the repetitive lines and the toned textural detail. The people are too far away to make out detail - because of that I think this might be stronger with a single person creating a stronger silhouette/ shape in the doorway.</td>', 'Love the foreground, with the tilt, the repetitive lines and the toned textural detail. The people are too far away to make out detail - because of that I think this might be stronger with a single person creating a stronger silhouette/ shape in the doorway.', '2006-06-14 16:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2517246, 347043, 9149, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Perhaps the ship should be more in focus and the foreground a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Nice colors. Perhaps the ship should be more in focus and the foreground a bit out of focus.', '2006-06-14 16:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2517247, 347309, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of depth to the image, like the motion in the walking foreground people against the stillness of the passenger.</td>', 'Nice sense of depth to the image, like the motion in the walking foreground people against the stillness of the passenger.', '2006-06-14 16:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2517261, 345688, 9149, '<td valign="top">I think framing hear is a bit distracting. What are you framing? The eyes, the face?</td>', 'I think framing hear is a bit distracting. What are you framing? The eyes, the face?', '2006-06-14 16:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2517270, 346087, 9149, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a triptych than a framing. Which is the point of interest?  Colors are really nice.</td>', 'This looks more like a triptych than a framing. Which is the point of interest?  Colors are really nice.', '2006-06-14 16:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2517271, 347087, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet portrait and nicely framed. I also really like the unconventional composition with the main interest being tucked into the lower right corner rather than placed carefully on a third. The contrast between the grey of the wood and the vibrant colour of child and accessories works well.</td>', 'Sweet portrait and nicely framed. I also really like the unconventional composition with the main interest being tucked into the lower right corner rather than placed carefully on a third. The contrast between the grey of the wood and the vibrant colour of child and accessories works well.', '2006-06-14 16:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
