(2518227, 345887, 24512, '<td valign="top">Fit to Contest:	3	out of	5, no real bottom frame, forground meant as frame is out of focus and not consistent with the trees framing the rest of the picture.<br/>Technical Quality			<br/>Exposure/Lighting:	3	out of	5, subjects are a little dark and detail is lost.<br/>Color/Graysale	3  out of	5, background is a little washed out. contrast is a little flat.<br/>Focus/Sharpness	4	out of	5, again, the forground is out of focus and somewhat of a distracting element that doesn''t fit with the rest of the picture.<br/>Composition			<br/>Crop/Layout	4	out of	5, not bad but probably could have been better if you weren''t trying to "frame" them for this contest.<br/>Elements/Lines	4	out of	5<br/>Scale to 9	6.3	out of	9<br/>Subjective stuff			<br/>Interesting subject	.1	Everybody loves deer :)<br/>Rounded total	6</td>', 'Fit to Contest:	3	out of	5, no real bottom frame, forground meant as frame is out of focus and not consistent with the trees framing the rest of the picture.Technical Quality			Exposure/Lighting:	3	out of	5, subjects are a little dark and detail is lost.Color/Graysale	3  out of	5, background is a little washed out. contrast is a little flat.Focus/Sharpness	4	out of	5, again, the forground is out of focus and somewhat of a distracting element that doesn''t fit with the rest of the picture.Composition			Crop/Layout	4	out of	5, not bad but probably could have been better if you weren''t trying to "frame" them for this contest.Elements/Lines	4	out of	5Scale to 9	6.3	out of	9Subjective stuff			Interesting subject	.1	Everybody loves deer :)Rounded total	6', '2006-06-14 22:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518228, 345877, 52336, '<td valign="top">Actually kinda disturbing subject matter.  Framed it is, though.</td>', 'Actually kinda disturbing subject matter.  Framed it is, though.', '2006-06-14 22:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
