(2518271, 346639, 55642, '<td valign="top">The sky has gone turquoise.. looks like you added some yellow tone to compensate for somereally harsh midday light. This would be stunning at dawn or dusk, depending on which way this faces.</td>', 'The sky has gone turquoise.. looks like you added some yellow tone to compensate for somereally harsh midday light. This would be stunning at dawn or dusk, depending on which way this faces.', '2006-06-14 22:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
