(2518275, 345272, 33361, '<td valign="top">fabulous image</td>', 'fabulous image', '2006-06-14 22:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518276, 346483, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing. This picture gives a sense of sadness; I don''t know quite why. My only wish is that I could see it as a whole, but it is too deep to fit my monitor. That''s always a tradeoff in vertical shots - a good size versus the inability of many monitors to take in the whole shot at once.</td>', 'Very nice framing. This picture gives a sense of sadness; I don''t know quite why. My only wish is that I could see it as a whole, but it is too deep to fit my monitor. That''s always a tradeoff in vertical shots - a good size versus the inability of many monitors to take in the whole shot at once.', '2006-06-14 22:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518277, 347594, 33361, '<td valign="top">fab!! 10</td>', 'fab!! 10', '2006-06-14 22:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518278, 347269, 33361, '<td valign="top">love the bird drinking... 9</td>', 'love the bird drinking... 9', '2006-06-14 22:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518279, 346989, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting mental exercise to figure out what it is you''re looking through. I wasn''t able to do it. Interesting picture, nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'An interesting mental exercise to figure out what it is you''re looking through. I wasn''t able to do it. Interesting picture, nice take on the challenge.', '2006-06-14 22:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
