(2518284, 346148, 12733, '<td valign="top">Both the frame and the picture inside are interesting. I really like this picture, and I wish I could see it all at once - but it''s deeper than my monitor can show, even set for full frame. That''s always a tradeoff in vertical shots - a good size versus the inability of many monitors to take in the whole shot at once.</td>', 'Both the frame and the picture inside are interesting. I really like this picture, and I wish I could see it all at once - but it''s deeper than my monitor can show, even set for full frame. That''s always a tradeoff in vertical shots - a good size versus the inability of many monitors to take in the whole shot at once.', '2006-06-14 22:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518285, 346733, 33361, '<td valign="top">looks like e301 or zeuszen...either way a fabulous image 9</td>', 'looks like e301 or zeuszen...either way a fabulous image 9', '2006-06-14 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518286, 345335, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, looks familiar... ;-)</td>', 'Hmmm, looks familiar... ;-)', '2006-06-14 22:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518287, 347309, 33361, '<td valign="top">perfecto! 10</td>', 'perfecto! 10', '2006-06-14 22:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518288, 345198, 33361, '<td valign="top">great capture 9</td>', 'great capture 9', '2006-06-14 22:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518292, 347588, 33361, '<td valign="top">love it - 10</td>', 'love it - 10', '2006-06-14 22:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518293, 346803, 33361, '<td valign="top">very nice 9</td>', 'very nice 9', '2006-06-14 22:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518294, 346733, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the way the figure takes you through the tunnel and out the other side. The buildings outside the tunnel take on an air of mystery because of her presence. Unfortunately, I could not see the picture as a whole on my monitor, and had to scrool through it in parts. That''s always a tradeoff in vertical shots - a good size versus the inability of many monitors to take in the whole shot at once.</td>', 'I like the way the figure takes you through the tunnel and out the other side. The buildings outside the tunnel take on an air of mystery because of her presence. Unfortunately, I could not see the picture as a whole on my monitor, and had to scrool through it in parts. That''s always a tradeoff in vertical shots - a good size versus the inability of many monitors to take in the whole shot at once.', '2006-06-14 22:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518301, 346145, 33361, '<td valign="top">would like to see this cropped just a hair...love everything else 8</td>', 'would like to see this cropped just a hair...love everything else 8', '2006-06-14 22:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518303, 347584, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the way the frame creates two distinct pictures, and the way they play off each other.</td>', 'I like the way the frame creates two distinct pictures, and the way they play off each other.', '2006-06-14 22:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518305, 347160, 33361, '<td valign="top">sweet 8</td>', 'sweet 8', '2006-06-14 22:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518313, 346571, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the framing, and I like the colors and angles. There''s a grainy quality that doesn''t seem to suit this theme - over sharpening? High ISO?</td>', 'I like the framing, and I like the colors and angles. There''s a grainy quality that doesn''t seem to suit this theme - over sharpening? High ISO?', '2006-06-14 22:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518315, 347104, 12733, '<td valign="top">This picture has a lot of snap - great colors, clarity and contrast between the buildings, the water and the trees.</td>', 'This picture has a lot of snap - great colors, clarity and contrast between the buildings, the water and the trees.', '2006-06-14 22:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518316, 347439, 33361, '<td valign="top">love this! 9</td>', 'love this! 9', '2006-06-14 22:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518319, 346748, 33361, '<td valign="top">wonderful..wish I was there!</td>', 'wonderful..wish I was there!', '2006-06-14 22:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518322, 347477, 22301, '<td valign="top">great find, I would have moved over to the left abit to get more of the mountain in frame. Also your colors  seem abit off, the mountain is abit too yellow. Just some suggestions.</td>', 'great find, I would have moved over to the left abit to get more of the mountain in frame. Also your colors  seem abit off, the mountain is abit too yellow. Just some suggestions.', '2006-06-14 22:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518324, 347278, 33361, '<td valign="top">you''ll probably get slammed for being a bit soft but I like it and the zen feel it gives the image 9</td>', 'you''ll probably get slammed for being a bit soft but I like it and the zen feel it gives the image 9', '2006-06-14 22:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518325, 346007, 12733, '<td valign="top">The contest rules allow up to 640 pixels, and for a horizontal shot most - if not all - monitors will show the whole picture. By making it this small, you lose the detail that would give the viewer some sense of what the picture is about.</td>', 'The contest rules allow up to 640 pixels, and for a horizontal shot most - if not all - monitors will show the whole picture. By making it this small, you lose the detail that would give the viewer some sense of what the picture is about.', '2006-06-14 22:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518329, 347082, 33361, '<td valign="top">fab image 9</td>', 'fab image 9', '2006-06-14 22:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518334, 347544, 33361, '<td valign="top">too cool! 9</td>', 'too cool! 9', '2006-06-14 22:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518335, 347352, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute picture. I would have liked to have seen it as a whole, but my monitor won''t hold the whole picture. I had to scroll through it. That''s always a tradeoff in vertical shots - a good size versus the inability of many monitors to take in the whole shot at once.<br/>No points off for the message - but isn''t there something sexist about not mentioning the prince?</td>', 'Very cute picture. I would have liked to have seen it as a whole, but my monitor won''t hold the whole picture. I had to scroll through it. That''s always a tradeoff in vertical shots - a good size versus the inability of many monitors to take in the whole shot at once.No points off for the message - but isn''t there something sexist about not mentioning the prince?', '2006-06-14 22:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518339, 346867, 33361, '<td valign="top">love the colors, textures and crop..9</td>', 'love the colors, textures and crop..9', '2006-06-14 22:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518342, 346734, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but the "frame" doesn''t cover much of it. I think a close crop around the magnifying glass would frame the picture, rather than having the picture frame the glass.</td>', 'I like the picture, but the "frame" doesn''t cover much of it. I think a close crop around the magnifying glass would frame the picture, rather than having the picture frame the glass.', '2006-06-14 22:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
