(2518348, 346575, 12733, '<td valign="top">Pretty sunset, and the figure gives the whole picture scale - both the frame and the enclosed seascape.</td>', 'Pretty sunset, and the figure gives the whole picture scale - both the frame and the enclosed seascape.', '2006-06-14 22:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518349, 347368, 33361, '<td valign="top">great capture..or set-up..it works 9</td>', 'great capture..or set-up..it works 9', '2006-06-14 22:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518352, 346891, 33361, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors 9</td>', 'beautiful colors 9', '2006-06-14 22:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518354, 346989, 55642, '<td valign="top">I think that this would be ribbon material if it were larger. Why not take advantage of the size allowances?</td>', 'I think that this would be ribbon material if it were larger. Why not take advantage of the size allowances?', '2006-06-14 22:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518355, 346157, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but kind of a ho-hum subject and treatment.</td>', 'Nice idea, but kind of a ho-hum subject and treatment.', '2006-06-14 22:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518366, 347524, 12733, '<td valign="top">You''ve got the classic frame for choosing a shot and a lens turned inside out. Cute idea, cute model, great picture.</td>', 'You''ve got the classic frame for choosing a shot and a lens turned inside out. Cute idea, cute model, great picture.', '2006-06-14 22:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518368, 347043, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty textures in the frame, nice seascape and catamaran.</td>', 'Very pretty textures in the frame, nice seascape and catamaran.', '2006-06-14 22:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518372, 346814, 12733, '<td valign="top">If life gives you lemons, make lemonade. I always find the fences frustrating when shooting sports - so it''s great to see them used to meet a challenge and enhance the picture.</td>', 'If life gives you lemons, make lemonade. I always find the fences frustrating when shooting sports - so it''s great to see them used to meet a challenge and enhance the picture.', '2006-06-14 22:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518378, 347177, 22301, '<td valign="top">hmm looks familiar, glad you put an entry into this challenge too. you seem to have some strange colors/artifacts where the opening in the trees in the sky. If you use the full allowable 150 kb size, it will help get rid of that, yours is 77kb. hope that helps and good luck.</td>', 'hmm looks familiar, glad you put an entry into this challenge too. you seem to have some strange colors/artifacts where the opening in the trees in the sky. If you use the full allowable 150 kb size, it will help get rid of that, yours is 77kb. hope that helps and good luck.', '2006-06-14 22:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518384, 347106, 12733, '<td valign="top">A lovely photo - I wish I could see it all at once. My monitor, even set on full screen, does not allow me to see this picture without scrolling. I can imagine, but not see, how it all fits together. I can see the top of Hardwick Hall without the herb garden, or I can see the garden and the first two stories of Hardwick Hall.<br/>That''s always a tradeoff in vertical shots - a good size versus the inability of many monitors to take in the whole shot at once.<br/>Sorry about the rant, it won''t affect the score, but I''ve been finding it frustrating when pictures that clearly should be seen as a whole are too big to fit the screen.</td>', 'A lovely photo - I wish I could see it all at once. My monitor, even set on full screen, does not allow me to see this picture without scrolling. I can imagine, but not see, how it all fits together. I can see the top of Hardwick Hall without the herb garden, or I can see the garden and the first two stories of Hardwick Hall.That''s always a tradeoff in vertical shots - a good size versus the inability of many monitors to take in the whole shot at once.Sorry about the rant, it won''t affect the score, but I''ve been finding it frustrating when pictures that clearly should be seen as a whole are too big to fit the screen.', '2006-06-14 22:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518387, 347241, 48228, '<td valign="top">I love the feeling this image give me.....</td>', 'I love the feeling this image give me.....', '2006-06-14 22:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518389, 347488, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, nicely executed. I think you could have cropped a lot from the top without losing anything. This would focus attention more on the main subject.</td>', 'Cute idea, nicely executed. I think you could have cropped a lot from the top without losing anything. This would focus attention more on the main subject.', '2006-06-14 22:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
