(2518454, 345694, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, nice model. Unfortunately, I have to guess what the picture looks like as a whole, since it won''t all fit on my monitor. This doesn''t lower the score, but it is irritating.<br/>I know the maximum size is 640 pixels, but in a vertical shot that means it is too big for many monitors. That''s always a tradeoff in vertical shots - a good size versus the inability to take in the whole shot at once.</td>', 'Nice shot, nice model. Unfortunately, I have to guess what the picture looks like as a whole, since it won''t all fit on my monitor. This doesn''t lower the score, but it is irritating.I know the maximum size is 640 pixels, but in a vertical shot that means it is too big for many monitors. That''s always a tradeoff in vertical shots - a good size versus the inability to take in the whole shot at once.', '2006-06-14 23:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
