(2519238, 347453, 23430, '<td valign="top">Like your frame a lot. The shape and the gradient of it look great. Good job putting it off-centre too. It''s a shame it''s basic editing. You could have added some brightness and contrast  and/or saturation to the foreground of your scene to go with that lovely sky. The composition of your scene is good too.</td>', 'Like your frame a lot. The shape and the gradient of it look great. Good job putting it off-centre too. It''s a shame it''s basic editing. You could have added some brightness and contrast  and/or saturation to the foreground of your scene to go with that lovely sky. The composition of your scene is good too.', '2006-06-15 07:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2519239, 346845, 49973, '<td valign="top">One of those pics you look at for ages.  Well done</td>', 'One of those pics you look at for ages.  Well done', '2006-06-15 07:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2519240, 346959, 12733, '<td valign="top">The driftwood textures are really great, and the addition of a human figure makes the "inside" picture interesting on its own.<br/>Not that it affects the score, but something to think about: a vertical picture of more than about 520 pixels tall won''t fit many monitors. I had to scroll this picture to see all of it, meaning I don''t see it as a whole. On my monitor, even with the full-screen function enabled, I can''t see your whole frame without scrolling.</td>', 'The driftwood textures are really great, and the addition of a human figure makes the "inside" picture interesting on its own.Not that it affects the score, but something to think about: a vertical picture of more than about 520 pixels tall won''t fit many monitors. I had to scroll this picture to see all of it, meaning I don''t see it as a whole. On my monitor, even with the full-screen function enabled, I can''t see your whole frame without scrolling.', '2006-06-15 07:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2519241, 346803, 49973, '<td valign="top">really draws you in and well framed</td>', 'really draws you in and well framed', '2006-06-15 07:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2519242, 346908, 49973, '<td valign="top">not really a frame and not really a subject within it worth loooking at.  You know you could do better!</td>', 'not really a frame and not really a subject within it worth loooking at.  You know you could do better!', '2006-06-15 07:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2519243, 345272, 60507, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot, you should be proud</td>', 'this is a great shot, you should be proud', '2006-06-15 07:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
