(2519254, 347033, 23430, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot although I don''t see a frame. Your composition may be improved if the horizon was brought down a bit lower as your sky i squished, but maybe not. Your DOF is perfect as is your foreground.</td>', 'Really nice shot although I don''t see a frame. Your composition may be improved if the horizon was brought down a bit lower as your sky i squished, but maybe not. Your DOF is perfect as is your foreground.', '2006-06-15 07:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
