(2522405, 347548, 56828, '<td valign="top">This photo has no real set frame.  There is a lot of negative space on the right and at the bottom of the photo.  You probably should have zoomed in on the toad a little more.  The object on the left really hinders the photo.  And there could be some adjustment with the brightness and contrast</td>', 'This photo has no real set frame.  There is a lot of negative space on the right and at the bottom of the photo.  You probably should have zoomed in on the toad a little more.  The object on the left really hinders the photo.  And there could be some adjustment with the brightness and contrast', '2006-06-16 12:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2522406, 345384, 56828, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what you are trying to achieve. I don''t see how your foreground frames the background.  There is no real set subject, there is a huge pillar in front, but the backround distracts from that.</td>', 'I don''t understand what you are trying to achieve. I don''t see how your foreground frames the background.  There is no real set subject, there is a huge pillar in front, but the backround distracts from that.', '2006-06-16 12:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
