(2525793, 346845, 28054, '<td valign="top">The frame has a lot of emphasis in this shot, maybe a little too much for my tastes. I''d quite like to see a black and white version of this, I think it may work better.</td>', 'The frame has a lot of emphasis in this shot, maybe a little too much for my tastes. I''d quite like to see a black and white version of this, I think it may work better.', '2006-06-18 07:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
