(2525795, 347528, 28054, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, I think the flower in the centre which is in focus loses some of its emphasis as its fairly small in relation to the rest of the picture. Maybe crop into it, and use a slightly shallower Depth of Field for extra emphasis.</td>', 'Interesting shot, I think the flower in the centre which is in focus loses some of its emphasis as its fairly small in relation to the rest of the picture. Maybe crop into it, and use a slightly shallower Depth of Field for extra emphasis.', '2006-06-18 07:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
