(2526613, 346891, 5792, '<td valign="top">Actually, if this was taken in the Page, Arizona area it would be Navajo Limestone, I believe. Nice colors, good lighting and a perspective you don''t often see in a slot canyon image. Perhaps this is Lower Antelope Canyon? Looks a bit oversaturated red to me but it is always hard to tell with these lower light level shots. I really like slot canyon photography. I have some upper antelope canyon images here:<br/>//www.pbase.com/azleader/antelopecanyon</td>', 'Actually, if this was taken in the Page, Arizona area it would be Navajo Limestone, I believe. Nice colors, good lighting and a perspective you don''t often see in a slot canyon image. Perhaps this is Lower Antelope Canyon? Looks a bit oversaturated red to me but it is always hard to tell with these lower light level shots. I really like slot canyon photography. I have some upper antelope canyon images here://www.pbase.com/azleader/antelopecanyon', '2006-06-18 18:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526616, 347544, 28532, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2006-06-18 18:12:44.000000', NULL, 1);
