(2529464, 346803, 59926, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective!!</td>', 'Nice perspective!!', '2006-06-19 18:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529467, 347379, 60583, '<td valign="top">Is that a bug on the right side? if so, he posed perfectly for the shot.  Nice job!</td>', 'Is that a bug on the right side? if so, he posed perfectly for the shot.  Nice job!', '2006-06-19 18:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529474, 345707, 60583, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, but the lighting seems too harsh.  You might try including the top of the "frame" also.</td>', 'Cute picture, but the lighting seems too harsh.  You might try including the top of the "frame" also.', '2006-06-19 18:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529478, 345683, 60583, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene; very interesting approach to an overly-photographed subject.  Use of flash works very well here, too.</td>', 'Beautiful scene; very interesting approach to an overly-photographed subject.  Use of flash works very well here, too.', '2006-06-19 18:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529481, 347537, 60583, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see your point of view just a bit lower, so the land and the sky were both "framed" separeately, instead of letting the land peek into the top frame.</td>', 'I would have liked to see your point of view just a bit lower, so the land and the sky were both "framed" separeately, instead of letting the land peek into the top frame.', '2006-06-19 18:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529488, 346891, 60583, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures.  Is she red from color tweaking, or from the red stones surrounding her?</td>', 'Beautiful textures.  Is she red from color tweaking, or from the red stones surrounding her?', '2006-06-19 18:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529491, 346446, 60583, '<td valign="top">Cropped ''frame'' works well here.  Nice job.</td>', 'Cropped ''frame'' works well here.  Nice job.', '2006-06-19 18:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529494, 347293, 60583, '<td valign="top">Very cute, but the flash lighting seems too harsh &amp; flattening.</td>', 'Very cute, but the flash lighting seems too harsh & flattening.', '2006-06-19 18:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529507, 347368, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good.  More refined crop possibly, but difficult given the incorporation of the sign.  Possibly could have manipulated the ''edges'' more in advanced, but still a good candid framing for basic.  Possibly a b&amp;w/toning effect could have given this an extra edge, who knows.</td>', '6 - Good.  More refined crop possibly, but difficult given the incorporation of the sign.  Possibly could have manipulated the ''edges'' more in advanced, but still a good candid framing for basic.  Possibly a b&w/toning effect could have given this an extra edge, who knows.', '2006-06-19 18:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529517, 347419, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Like the square framing and toning, but unless I am mistaken, it is the ''little thumb'' that has been framed here, which is not visible enough due to focus, toning and composition issues, in my opinion - plus - well, not sure ''why'' one would frame a thumb, unless it is a ''personal shot''.</td>', '3 - Like the square framing and toning, but unless I am mistaken, it is the ''little thumb'' that has been framed here, which is not visible enough due to focus, toning and composition issues, in my opinion - plus - well, not sure ''why'' one would frame a thumb, unless it is a ''personal shot''.', '2006-06-19 18:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529528, 345683, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Quite a nice shot, especially of the sky - framing just not strong enough in my opinion.  Perhaps a variation in cropping may have helped - that is if you were unable to loop up that leg rope(?) or ski to form the top ''edge''.  Looks like some slight ''fill flash'' issues as well, but apologies in advance if wrong.</td>', '4 - Quite a nice shot, especially of the sky - framing just not strong enough in my opinion.  Perhaps a variation in cropping may have helped - that is if you were unable to loop up that leg rope(?) or ski to form the top ''edge''.  Looks like some slight ''fill flash'' issues as well, but apologies in advance if wrong.', '2006-06-19 18:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529537, 346963, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Difficult, perhaps a more refined crop, especially at the bottom may have given this a little extra - also incorporating more on the sides, which I''m guessing you didn''t have or would have included.   Overall a little dark, like to see more detail in both the gazebo and view, so perhaps a deeper dof.  Lighting tweaked too, especially for the gazebo, but likely difficult, especially in basic.  Nice view, just needs a more refined ''framing'' in my opinion, ''somehow''.</td>', '3 - Difficult, perhaps a more refined crop, especially at the bottom may have given this a little extra - also incorporating more on the sides, which I''m guessing you didn''t have or would have included.   Overall a little dark, like to see more detail in both the gazebo and view, so perhaps a deeper dof.  Lighting tweaked too, especially for the gazebo, but likely difficult, especially in basic.  Nice view, just needs a more refined ''framing'' in my opinion, ''somehow''.', '2006-06-19 18:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529542, 346867, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good control of the whites.  Like the concept.  More ''food'' to balance this out, especially with the title/concept and the ''bits'' around on the red fixed (at time of shooting mostly - as realize difficult in basic pp), make this better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Good control of the whites.  Like the concept.  More ''food'' to balance this out, especially with the title/concept and the ''bits'' around on the red fixed (at time of shooting mostly - as realize difficult in basic pp), make this better in my opinion.', '2006-06-19 18:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
