(2529553, 346896, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Like the potential.  Framing not strong enough in my opinion.  More frame, better focus, including dof/focal placement and a nudge rotate up on the left, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Like the potential.  Framing not strong enough in my opinion.  More frame, better focus, including dof/focal placement and a nudge rotate up on the left, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-06-19 19:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
