(2529582, 347448, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Don''t mind the concept.  Perhaps a little more ''she'' incorporated would have made this a little stronger.  Colors/contrast seem a little oversatured/blown/something.</td>', '4 - Don''t mind the concept.  Perhaps a little more ''she'' incorporated would have made this a little stronger.  Colors/contrast seem a little oversatured/blown/something.', '2006-06-19 19:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
