(2529601, 347587, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Difficult, but the ''frame'' in better focus and looks like possibly contrast/saturation issues overall.  Also difficult, but a variation in cropping, depending what you had to work with, also likely helped this in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Difficult, but the ''frame'' in better focus and looks like possibly contrast/saturation issues overall.  Also difficult, but a variation in cropping, depending what you had to work with, also likely helped this in my opinion.', '2006-06-19 19:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
