(2529615, 347415, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Technically quite good.  Overall, ''too much information'' and not subtle enough in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Technically quite good.  Overall, ''too much information'' and not subtle enough in my opinion.', '2006-06-19 19:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
