(2529744, 346994, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good, but like to see more definition and color in the fore foliage/frame - not sure how, perhaps fill flash, coupled with some tweaking pp.</td>', '6 - Good, but like to see more definition and color in the fore foliage/frame - not sure how, perhaps fill flash, coupled with some tweaking pp.', '2006-06-19 19:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529749, 347283, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good framing - but needs some tweaking, just not sure what to suggest.  Perhaps b&amp;w/toning and some sharpening/blurring, not sure - just to give this some drama and an edge.</td>', '5 - Good framing - but needs some tweaking, just not sure what to suggest.  Perhaps b&w/toning and some sharpening/blurring, not sure - just to give this some drama and an edge.', '2006-06-19 19:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
