(2529758, 346148, 59932, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtaposition!</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition!', '2006-06-19 20:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529760, 347365, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good.  Just looks like there are focal issues that are detracting overall too much in my opinion, but not sure.  Quality dependent, perhaps a really tight crop on the joggers, who knows - but likely a totally different image.  As is, perhaps a little off the left/right sides for more of a vertical framing, may have given this a little extra.  Also, could just be visually, but looks like it needs a fraction of a nudge rotate up on the left - the shadow play enhances that aspect in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Good.  Just looks like there are focal issues that are detracting overall too much in my opinion, but not sure.  Quality dependent, perhaps a really tight crop on the joggers, who knows - but likely a totally different image.  As is, perhaps a little off the left/right sides for more of a vertical framing, may have given this a little extra.  Also, could just be visually, but looks like it needs a fraction of a nudge rotate up on the left - the shadow play enhances that aspect in my opinion.', '2006-06-19 20:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
