(2530143, 347047, 15497, '<td valign="top">Another great framing, looks really cool with the blue tint!</td>', 'Another great framing, looks really cool with the blue tint!', '2006-06-19 22:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530145, 346257, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - Struggling to see how you <i>have</i> "framed the frames" here, in the spirit of the Challenge.</td>', '1 - Struggling to see how you have "framed the frames" here, in the spirit of the Challenge.', '2006-06-19 22:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530147, 345815, 15497, '<td valign="top">Great colors and subject, and it''s very sharp! I like the frame too!<br/> <br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Great colors and subject, and it''s very sharp! I like the frame too!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-06-19 22:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530149, 347323, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Unusual.  A little further out, incorporating the brass(?) circular rim/frame and focus ''tweaking'' make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Unusual.  A little further out, incorporating the brass(?) circular rim/frame and focus ''tweaking'' make this better in my opinion.', '2006-06-19 22:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530152, 347439, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Very good - shame with the size restrictions, and difficult to do much width-wise I imagine.  Like how you''ve seen the frames here.  Good pose capturing/timing as well.  Not sure, but perhaps a toning/b&amp;w/something treatment/effect pp may have given this something extra - but may be just a different ''image'' - if that makes sense.</td>', '6 - Very good - shame with the size restrictions, and difficult to do much width-wise I imagine.  Like how you''ve seen the frames here.  Good pose capturing/timing as well.  Not sure, but perhaps a toning/b&w/something treatment/effect pp may have given this something extra - but may be just a different ''image'' - if that makes sense.', '2006-06-19 22:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530157, 345815, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Difficult.. wonder about a variation in composition/cropping, trying to use the most focussed leaves as your frame here rather than the oof fore ones, but not sure.  Also, overall, balance-wise, I wonder whether a horizontal framing/crop may have enhanced the natural framing that is there with the leaves, although it, the natural framing, is not as strong as I''d like to have seen for this Challenge.</td>', '4 - Difficult.. wonder about a variation in composition/cropping, trying to use the most focussed leaves as your frame here rather than the oof fore ones, but not sure.  Also, overall, balance-wise, I wonder whether a horizontal framing/crop may have enhanced the natural framing that is there with the leaves, although it, the natural framing, is not as strong as I''d like to have seen for this Challenge.', '2006-06-19 22:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530162, 346991, 57631, '<td valign="top">very small</td>', 'very small', '2006-06-19 22:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530167, 347524, 57631, '<td valign="top">lol so there!</td>', 'lol so there!', '2006-06-19 22:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530168, 346959, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good natural framing/potential.  Think if you ''timed'' the capturing of the girl and her movement differently, perhaps incorporating a pose - else more of a candid, make this better in my opinion.  Given both the clothing and textures in general, <i>maybe</i> some pp effects/toning/something could also have given this a little extra.  Focus seems quite good, just the motion capture/movement needs attention.</td>', '4 - Good natural framing/potential.  Think if you ''timed'' the capturing of the girl and her movement differently, perhaps incorporating a pose - else more of a candid, make this better in my opinion.  Given both the clothing and textures in general, maybe some pp effects/toning/something could also have given this a little extra.  Focus seems quite good, just the motion capture/movement needs attention.', '2006-06-19 22:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530173, 346867, 57631, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color</td>', 'Beautiful color', '2006-06-19 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530174, 347044, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - If you put as much effort into taking a naturally framed shot as you did in pp, would have been better.</td>', '1 - If you put as much effort into taking a naturally framed shot as you did in pp, would have been better.', '2006-06-19 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530180, 347528, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like this, especially the colors.  Would like to have seen the fence/frame in focus too though, however does work well as is in my opinion, just not dominant enough framewise for this Challenge.</td>', '5 - Like this, especially the colors.  Would like to have seen the fence/frame in focus too though, however does work well as is in my opinion, just not dominant enough framewise for this Challenge.', '2006-06-19 22:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530185, 347379, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Good focal control seemingly.  Just wish that the bone(?) was as focally uniform all the way around your ''frame'', as is bottom right - and more of it included too.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Good focal control seemingly.  Just wish that the bone(?) was as focally uniform all the way around your ''frame'', as is bottom right - and more of it included too.', '2006-06-19 22:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530202, 346891, 15497, '<td valign="top">Fantastic light, and lovely colors! I love all photos I''ve seen from these caves! Did you have a good trip up here? Great capture, and a ribbon winning one for sure! 10</td>', 'Fantastic light, and lovely colors! I love all photos I''ve seen from these caves! Did you have a good trip up here? Great capture, and a ribbon winning one for sure! 10', '2006-06-19 22:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530204, 347449, 15497, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture, lovely framing and lovely tones, I think this might get a ribbon! :D<br/> <br/>Good luck! 10</td>', 'This is a great capture, lovely framing and lovely tones, I think this might get a ribbon! :D Good luck! 10', '2006-06-19 22:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530224, 345879, 44453, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, not entirely sure what it it but it''s a wonderful study of light and shadow</td>', 'Beautiful, not entirely sure what it it but it''s a wonderful study of light and shadow', '2006-06-19 22:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530239, 347613, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Whilst you have somewhat ''cheated'' and also gone against the spirit of the Challenge by ''just using a frame/matt'' - as a portrait this is not bad, however trying to get more ''expression'' on Poppy''s face, may have made this more special, as well as a more finely tuned crop, especially at the bottom.  Overall, likely what you were aiming for, however doesn''t really meet the Challenge strongly enough, in my opinion.</td>', '2 - Whilst you have somewhat ''cheated'' and also gone against the spirit of the Challenge by ''just using a frame/matt'' - as a portrait this is not bad, however trying to get more ''expression'' on Poppy''s face, may have made this more special, as well as a more finely tuned crop, especially at the bottom.  Overall, likely what you were aiming for, however doesn''t really meet the Challenge strongly enough, in my opinion.', '2006-06-19 22:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530242, 347376, 27839, '<td valign="top">I like the way the photo makes me fill a tilted to the left!  NEAT!</td>', 'I like the way the photo makes me fill a tilted to the left!  NEAT!', '2006-06-19 22:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530268, 347104, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Looks like some contrast issues in your fore/frame.  Overall, subject/scene just not holding my attention, perhaps a variation in toning may have given this extra, not sure, otherwise I''m seeing primarily plain high-rise architecture.</td>', '3 - Looks like some contrast issues in your fore/frame.  Overall, subject/scene just not holding my attention, perhaps a variation in toning may have given this extra, not sure, otherwise I''m seeing primarily plain high-rise architecture.', '2006-06-19 22:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530274, 346876, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Not sure if you were going for an abstract type image here, if so, potential is there.  I think more definition, stronger lighting and a variation in the background/base color (as is detracts from the subject), may have made this better in my opinion.  The ''frame'' itself, also not as strong as I''d like to have seen for this Challenge.</td>', '2 - Not sure if you were going for an abstract type image here, if so, potential is there.  I think more definition, stronger lighting and a variation in the background/base color (as is detracts from the subject), may have made this better in my opinion.  The ''frame'' itself, also not as strong as I''d like to have seen for this Challenge.', '2006-06-19 22:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530286, 347160, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Very nice portrait, but yes you ''cheated'' primarily, in my opinion.  Toning works well, overall seems a little .. dark.  A more finely tuned crop, especially on the left, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Very nice portrait, but yes you ''cheated'' primarily, in my opinion.  Toning works well, overall seems a little .. dark.  A more finely tuned crop, especially on the left, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-06-19 22:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530291, 346540, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good compositional framing, however would like to have seen the frame more in focus for this Challenge.</td>', '3 - Good compositional framing, however would like to have seen the frame more in focus for this Challenge.', '2006-06-19 22:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530297, 346155, 27839, '<td valign="top">The curtains and the sun catcher ruin the shot.</td>', 'The curtains and the sun catcher ruin the shot.', '2006-06-19 22:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530304, 345887, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wow this is amazing. Wonderful capture. Outstanding, a winner IMO. 10</td>', 'Wow this is amazing. Wonderful capture. Outstanding, a winner IMO. 10', '2006-06-19 22:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530307, 345879, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Not sure what I''m looking at here, however on close inspection, can decipher a ''natural framing'' - just, but it is not ''the foreground subject'' that is framing the rest of the image, so <i>is</i> a stretch.  Unusual pp and colors though, fairly interesting abstract type image, perhaps a little ''dark'' for my taste.  Good composition/balance.</td>', '3 - Not sure what I''m looking at here, however on close inspection, can decipher a ''natural framing'' - just, but it is not ''the foreground subject'' that is framing the rest of the image, so is a stretch.  Unusual pp and colors though, fairly interesting abstract type image, perhaps a little ''dark'' for my taste.  Good composition/balance.', '2006-06-19 22:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530309, 347456, 27839, '<td valign="top">The photo is cute, but you can''t tell you are viewing her through a log.</td>', 'The photo is cute, but you can''t tell you are viewing her through a log.', '2006-06-19 22:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530310, 345390, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - DMC.</td>', '1 - DMC.', '2006-06-19 22:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530311, 346484, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding shot. Wonderful composition. 10</td>', 'This is an outstanding shot. Wonderful composition. 10', '2006-06-19 22:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530316, 346575, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good.  A more finely tuned crop at the top, minimizing the fill-flash effect (apologies in advance if it is not fill-flash), make this better in my opinion, as well as some tweaking in pp for added drama/depth, though I realize difficult in basic.</td>', '6 - Good.  A more finely tuned crop at the top, minimizing the fill-flash effect (apologies in advance if it is not fill-flash), make this better in my opinion, as well as some tweaking in pp for added drama/depth, though I realize difficult in basic.', '2006-06-19 22:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530321, 346118, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice.  Even though the foreground ''framing'' is oof, it is dominant enough to show a definite framing here, however would like to have seen more of it, including focus, for this Challenge.</td>', '5 - Nice.  Even though the foreground ''framing'' is oof, it is dominant enough to show a definite framing here, however would like to have seen more of it, including focus, for this Challenge.', '2006-06-19 22:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530323, 347445, 47541, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been much better if the bottom branch was cropped in a manner similar to the top one - other than that its a lovely scene</td>', 'I think this would have been much better if the bottom branch was cropped in a manner similar to the top one - other than that its a lovely scene', '2006-06-19 23:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530327, 347044, 44453, '<td valign="top">a work of sheer genius</td>', 'a work of sheer genius', '2006-06-19 23:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530328, 347368, 44453, '<td valign="top">this is great in so many ways</td>', 'this is great in so many ways', '2006-06-19 23:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530330, 346170, 27839, '<td valign="top">I looked really close.</td>', 'I looked really close.', '2006-06-19 23:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530332, 347309, 44453, '<td valign="top">very good candid - 9</td>', 'very good candid - 9', '2006-06-19 23:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530333, 347530, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - This looks a bit snapshottish and like someone spying through trees.. Further back, the trees in focus, better focus on the subjects, angle adjustment to lose the branch disrupting one of the subjects and a nudge rotate up on the right, make this better in my opinion.  Quality dependent, 640 would have helped you too.</td>', '2 - This looks a bit snapshottish and like someone spying through trees.. Further back, the trees in focus, better focus on the subjects, angle adjustment to lose the branch disrupting one of the subjects and a nudge rotate up on the right, make this better in my opinion.  Quality dependent, 640 would have helped you too.', '2006-06-19 23:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530340, 345926, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice.  Toning works very well.  Like to have seen a variation in/more of the ''natural framing'', especially for this Challenge, but <i>is</i> nice as is.  The building in the rear on the left detracts slightly, so perhaps trying to crop/angle that out may have helped.</td>', '6 - Nice.  Toning works very well.  Like to have seen a variation in/more of the ''natural framing'', especially for this Challenge, but is nice as is.  The building in the rear on the left detracts slightly, so perhaps trying to crop/angle that out may have helped.', '2006-06-19 23:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530349, 347502, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good idea, works well, good capture.  Even though the ''foreground subject(s)'' are oof still showing a fairly well defined natural frame, and definitely gives more ''pop'' to the main subject.  For this Challenge however, I''d like to have seen the foreground subject(s) in focus and more dominant.  Perhaps a more finely tuned crop at the top (down to the helmet), would have given this a little extra/more balance overall, in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Good idea, works well, good capture.  Even though the ''foreground subject(s)'' are oof still showing a fairly well defined natural frame, and definitely gives more ''pop'' to the main subject.  For this Challenge however, I''d like to have seen the foreground subject(s) in focus and more dominant.  Perhaps a more finely tuned crop at the top (down to the helmet), would have given this a little extra/more balance overall, in my opinion.', '2006-06-19 23:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530371, 347087, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - That''s more like it.  Good composition, good textures, good subject, interesting with the glasses.  Skin on fingers has too much ''red'' in it, but difficult I realize to adjust in basic.  Quality overall - perhaps could use some refinement - can see traces of jpeg loss/haloing/something and would like to have seen more definition in the wood texture and just overall more ''depth''.</td>', '7 - That''s more like it.  Good composition, good textures, good subject, interesting with the glasses.  Skin on fingers has too much ''red'' in it, but difficult I realize to adjust in basic.  Quality overall - perhaps could use some refinement - can see traces of jpeg loss/haloing/something and would like to have seen more definition in the wood texture and just overall more ''depth''.', '2006-06-19 23:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530383, 347453, 59478, '<td valign="top">this photo is a lot of fun...it''s very serene...i like it</td>', 'this photo is a lot of fun...it''s very serene...i like it', '2006-06-19 23:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530389, 346536, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Like to have seen the ''foreground'' in focus and also perfect (or near) perspective symmetry.  Looks like you have probably achieved what you were aiming for, however misses the mark for this Challenge in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Like to have seen the ''foreground'' in focus and also perfect (or near) perspective symmetry.  Looks like you have probably achieved what you were aiming for, however misses the mark for this Challenge in my opinion.', '2006-06-19 23:16:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2530394, 347106, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - A variation in cropping to ''use'' the framing more would have helped this in my opinion - overall just not holding my attention enough, needs a bit more ''drama''.  Possibly toning/pp effects could have done something, but the color capture <i>is</i> nice so who knows.</td>', '3 - A variation in cropping to ''use'' the framing more would have helped this in my opinion - overall just not holding my attention enough, needs a bit more ''drama''.  Possibly toning/pp effects could have done something, but the color capture is nice so who knows.', '2006-06-19 23:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530399, 344954, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice.  A much more finely tuned crop, else a little more of the unusual features, such as the wood upper left, incorporated and overall ''somehow'' adjusting pp to gain a little more ''depth'' make this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice.  A much more finely tuned crop, else a little more of the unusual features, such as the wood upper left, incorporated and overall ''somehow'' adjusting pp to gain a little more ''depth'' make this better in my opinion.', '2006-06-19 23:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530411, 345877, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Without your title, likely not have worked out what the ''frame'' is.  Having said that - what is it ''firing'' at - could be potential given selective ''audience''/people, who knows.  Overall the scene itself just not holding my attention.  Perhaps going for some pp/toning effect may have given this something extra.  Also more frame, and a nudge rotate up on the left for added overall balance.</td>', '3 - Without your title, likely not have worked out what the ''frame'' is.  Having said that - what is it ''firing'' at - could be potential given selective ''audience''/people, who knows.  Overall the scene itself just not holding my attention.  Perhaps going for some pp/toning effect may have given this something extra.  Also more frame, and a nudge rotate up on the left for added overall balance.', '2006-06-19 23:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530418, 347483, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Nice shot, but hard pushed to see any definite frame, even if an oof one.  Perhaps a sharper angle incorporating more of the red lillies(?), using them as a frame more, who knows.</td>', '3 - Nice shot, but hard pushed to see any definite frame, even if an oof one.  Perhaps a sharper angle incorporating more of the red lillies(?), using them as a frame more, who knows.', '2006-06-19 23:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530424, 347548, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - Too hard pushed to see a frame here - just see a toad and some ''yard stuff'' and a bit of harsh flash.  Doesn''t meet Challenge, in my opinion.</td>', '1 - Too hard pushed to see a frame here - just see a toad and some ''yard stuff'' and a bit of harsh flash.  Doesn''t meet Challenge, in my opinion.', '2006-06-19 23:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530429, 347584, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - A much tighter crop at the bottom may have produced an image with more interest - the houses detract too much overall.  The tree also more defined and visible, be better for this Challenge.</td>', '3 - A much tighter crop at the bottom may have produced an image with more interest - the houses detract too much overall.  The tree also more defined and visible, be better for this Challenge.', '2006-06-19 23:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530451, 345873, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. This framing suits this photo</td>', 'Nicely done. This framing suits this photo', '2006-06-19 23:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530454, 344827, 23953, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites! You nailed the exposure; I really like the sun rays coming through the clouds. I have this placing top 3....Good Luck!</td>', 'One of my favorites! You nailed the exposure; I really like the sun rays coming through the clouds. I have this placing top 3....Good Luck!', '2006-06-19 23:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530503, 347609, 50695, '<td valign="top">the eye makeup detracts from this very creative shot.</td>', 'the eye makeup detracts from this very creative shot.', '2006-06-20 00:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530505, 347376, 54431, '<td valign="top">I like the angle that this is on. Nice shot!</td>', 'I like the angle that this is on. Nice shot!', '2006-06-20 00:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530514, 347287, 50695, '<td valign="top">No, it''s Buffy!</td>', 'No, it''s Buffy!', '2006-06-20 00:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530524, 346593, 47541, '<td valign="top">The bright light at the end of the hall distracts me from the girl a little bit - I''m not sure which is the focus of the photo?</td>', 'The bright light at the end of the hall distracts me from the girl a little bit - I''m not sure which is the focus of the photo?', '2006-06-20 00:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530529, 347168, 47541, '<td valign="top">A shame the camera focussed on the tree and not the animal</td>', 'A shame the camera focussed on the tree and not the animal', '2006-06-20 00:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530533, 347541, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great title and framing. Tough lighting though. Hard to take a photo at this time of day.</td>', 'Great title and framing. Tough lighting though. Hard to take a photo at this time of day.', '2006-06-20 00:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530534, 347594, 33672, '<td valign="top">Well framed with leading lines.. Nice work.</td>', 'Well framed with leading lines.. Nice work.', '2006-06-20 00:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530538, 347145, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great shot. well framed and very clear. Subject has a nice comp within the arch. nice colors.</td>', 'Great shot. well framed and very clear. Subject has a nice comp within the arch. nice colors.', '2006-06-20 00:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530539, 346742, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and well framed. Looks a little like the Dansing Building in Prague. Is that right?</td>', 'Nice shot and well framed. Looks a little like the Dansing Building in Prague. Is that right?', '2006-06-20 00:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530542, 347502, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great shot but the motion blur of the batter is a bit distracting</td>', 'Great shot but the motion blur of the batter is a bit distracting', '2006-06-20 00:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530546, 347453, 18197, '<td valign="top">Someone once commented on one of my photos with a long title, "Have more faith in your shot, and the viewer''s intellignece to figure it out." This is a very nice photo which well meets the challenge. But the title diminishes it IMO.</td>', 'Someone once commented on one of my photos with a long title, "Have more faith in your shot, and the viewer''s intellignece to figure it out." This is a very nice photo which well meets the challenge. But the title diminishes it IMO.', '2006-06-20 00:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530547, 346245, 54431, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I wish the branch on the left was in focus just as much as the one on the right though.</td>', 'Nice shot, I wish the branch on the left was in focus just as much as the one on the right though.', '2006-06-20 00:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530549, 346541, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not really a framed subject but still a stunning photo.</td>', 'Not really a framed subject but still a stunning photo.', '2006-06-20 00:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
