(2533362, 347606, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good story, seemingly well thought out.  Good pose/expression.  Nice lighting, good amount of dof in rear - only thing for me in this shot for this Challenge is if the bike/wheel were more in focus, but difficult I realize to ''get it all'' - but to just have a more defined ''frame''.</td>', '7 - Good story, seemingly well thought out.  Good pose/expression.  Nice lighting, good amount of dof in rear - only thing for me in this shot for this Challenge is if the bike/wheel were more in focus, but difficult I realize to ''get it all'' - but to just have a more defined ''frame''.', '2006-06-20 23:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533363, 347269, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like the classic high contrast feel here.  the subject is great and the bird is definitive of the city.</td>', 'I like the classic high contrast feel here.  the subject is great and the bird is definitive of the city.', '2006-06-20 23:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533368, 347524, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice portrait.  The ''mini frame'' a fraction sharper for this Challenge, be better in my opinion.  Also, looks slightly soft/hazy - but could be my monitor - or intentional pp.</td>', '7 - Nice portrait.  The ''mini frame'' a fraction sharper for this Challenge, be better in my opinion.  Also, looks slightly soft/hazy - but could be my monitor - or intentional pp.', '2006-06-20 23:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533369, 347309, 38032, '<td valign="top">Awesome contrast - has a really alive feeling to it. The woman on the tright in the background is a neat discover too. fave.</td>', 'Awesome contrast - has a really alive feeling to it. The woman on the tright in the background is a neat discover too. fave.', '2006-06-20 23:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533372, 346989, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good and unusual.  Bigger (640 height in this case), slight variation in angle - to eliminate that ''line'' on the left which detracts, but fairly minor and possibly a little more detail in the ''hood'', make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good and unusual.  Bigger (640 height in this case), slight variation in angle - to eliminate that ''line'' on the left which detracts, but fairly minor and possibly a little more detail in the ''hood'', make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-06-20 23:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533386, 346845, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very good perspective and symmetry.  Didn''t notice the well placed tree on first look.  Overall, whilst the colors are quite strong and this image larger likely has a different impact, just not sure on the colors as is.  Perhaps, and possibly only because of this ''size'', a hue adjustment in the reds/pillars - else a toning effect, may have given this a little extra, not sure.</td>', '7 - Very good perspective and symmetry.  Didn''t notice the well placed tree on first look.  Overall, whilst the colors are quite strong and this image larger likely has a different impact, just not sure on the colors as is.  Perhaps, and possibly only because of this ''size'', a hue adjustment in the reds/pillars - else a toning effect, may have given this a little extra, not sure.', '2006-06-20 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533392, 345946, 5376, '<td valign="top">it is dark but that have been how you wanted it like the background</td>', 'it is dark but that have been how you wanted it like the background', '2006-06-20 23:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533393, 347309, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  B&amp;w works well with the simplicity.  The only thing, and is ''nit-picking'', is main subject/''interesting factor'', if that makes sense.  As is, very ''day to day'', which may well be your intention, but if (and obviously opportune), to capture more ''character'', make this even better in my opinion.  Like the big size/square crop.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Very good.  B&w works well with the simplicity.  The only thing, and is ''nit-picking'', is main subject/''interesting factor'', if that makes sense.  As is, very ''day to day'', which may well be your intention, but if (and obviously opportune), to capture more ''character'', make this even better in my opinion.  Like the big size/square crop.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-06-20 23:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533395, 347397, 5376, '<td valign="top">I have a pic that looks almost exactly like this!</td>', 'I have a pic that looks almost exactly like this!', '2006-06-20 23:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533397, 347453, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice composition, colors and lines.  Difficult, but if only the boat were more discernible - which, without your title, might have missed it.  Your title detracts too, but fairly minor.</td>', '7 - Nice composition, colors and lines.  Difficult, but if only the boat were more discernible - which, without your title, might have missed it.  Your title detracts too, but fairly minor.', '2006-06-20 23:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533398, 346896, 5376, '<td valign="top">i would like to see this in b&amp;w</td>', 'i would like to see this in b&w', '2006-06-20 23:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533400, 345272, 60776, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of symmetry</td>', 'Nice sense of symmetry', '2006-06-20 23:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533404, 347285, 5376, '<td valign="top">I love this</td>', 'I love this', '2006-06-20 23:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533407, 346748, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice colors, good use of framing.  Like to have seen the frame enhanced more ''somehow'' - whether a tighter crop, something in pp, not sure.  Texture and colors in the ''frame'' are good and would like to have seen those elements stronger.  Visually, looks like it is slanted downwards to the right, but I see the horizon is straight, so likely just a ''visual illusion'', but fairly minor.</td>', '7 - Very nice colors, good use of framing.  Like to have seen the frame enhanced more ''somehow'' - whether a tighter crop, something in pp, not sure.  Texture and colors in the ''frame'' are good and would like to have seen those elements stronger.  Visually, looks like it is slanted downwards to the right, but I see the horizon is straight, so likely just a ''visual illusion'', but fairly minor.', '2006-06-20 23:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533410, 347263, 38032, '<td valign="top">Great idea ... I  love the eroding foreground elements. With just a few adjustments this could be the winner IMO.  I think that slant or distortion hurt this a bit ... maybe a more strongly angled image would distract from the lens distortion or whatever is going on.  You could also maybe try moving either up or down with the camera to have more dramatic background perspective or something to focus the eye to. Another possiblity would be to have a more zoomed/cropped deal where the top and bottome are cropped out. Also: a polarizing filter might hold back some of the highlight in the background allowing for more interesting contrast.  i left all this because i like the image and feel this idea has great potential. 7</td>', 'Great idea ... I  love the eroding foreground elements. With just a few adjustments this could be the winner IMO.  I think that slant or distortion hurt this a bit ... maybe a more strongly angled image would distract from the lens distortion or whatever is going on.  You could also maybe try moving either up or down with the camera to have more dramatic background perspective or something to focus the eye to. Another possiblity would be to have a more zoomed/cropped deal where the top and bottome are cropped out. Also: a polarizing filter might hold back some of the highlight in the background allowing for more interesting contrast.  i left all this because i like the image and feel this idea has great potential. 7', '2006-06-20 23:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533414, 347363, 5376, '<td valign="top">I will give this a 9 just because :)</td>', 'I will give this a 9 just because :)', '2006-06-20 23:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
