(2533431, 347449, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Even though the frame here is mostly(?) a silhouette, the scene and toning/effects complement it very well, however for this Challenge <i>would</i> like to have seen a little more detail/texture/etc in the sides/top of the frame - similar to as is in the water/bottom of the frame.  Obviously lose a lot with the toning/pp but still likely make it even better in my opinion.  Good image.</td>', '7 - Even though the frame here is mostly(?) a silhouette, the scene and toning/effects complement it very well, however for this Challenge would like to have seen a little more detail/texture/etc in the sides/top of the frame - similar to as is in the water/bottom of the frame.  Obviously lose a lot with the toning/pp but still likely make it even better in my opinion.  Good image.', '2006-06-20 23:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
