(2534216, 344827, 19952, '<td valign="top"><i>Shot at Page, AZ just after a retreating storm. 3 shots using AEB and merged using PS HDR. No time to grab the gradND filter. <br/>Think it still came out well...and talk about timing as I was drenched wet during this shot.</i> <br/> <br/>Am I reading your description correctly that you took three separate photographs and merged them in Photoshop to create this single image? This is a gorgeous image, but if that''s how you did it, that''s not within the rules.</td>', 'Shot at Page, AZ just after a retreating storm. 3 shots using AEB and merged using PS HDR. No time to grab the gradND filter. Think it still came out well...and talk about timing as I was drenched wet during this shot.  Am I reading your description correctly that you took three separate photographs and merged them in Photoshop to create this single image? This is a gorgeous image, but if that''s how you did it, that''s not within the rules.', '2006-06-21 01:48:39.000000', NULL, 0),
