(2534677, 345879, 59361, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments ! :)<br/>First time above 6, first time in the 30th  !! WOW !!! :) i''m very happy !<br/>+ first time my picture is a favorite !!!<br/> <br/>this "thing" is view from under, it''s part of a roof .. <br/>the "moon" is up.<br/>It is a hole that was supposed to serve in a giant telescope, but<br/>it never worked well ...<br/>the funny form is just a fancyness of the architect<br/>The colored frames are verticals windows that hide a room in the roof.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-21 04:37:16.</i></td>', 'Thank you all for your comments ! :)First time above 6, first time in the 30th  !! WOW !!! :) i''m very happy !+ first time my picture is a favorite !!! this "thing" is view from under, it''s part of a roof .. the "moon" is up.It is a hole that was supposed to serve in a giant telescope, butit never worked well ...the funny form is just a fancyness of the architectThe colored frames are verticals windows that hide a room in the roof.', '2006-06-21 02:49:49.000000', '2006-06-21 05:37:16.000000', 0),
