(2534953, 344827, 57441, '<td valign="top">Post contest...<br/> <br/>I misread the basic editing rules of using a single photo only. This picture would not have been feasible without either a ND Grad or multiple exposures/HDR in PS. I want to thank all of you who voted for this picture.<br/> <br/>I will be careful of this rule in my next entry.<br/>Thanks<br/>Amit<br/> <br/>PS: If I read the basic editing rule correctly, even if I had used the ND Grad, it would have been DQ''d? Is this understanding correct?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-21 03:02:31.</i></td>', 'Post contest... I misread the basic editing rules of using a single photo only. This picture would not have been feasible without either a ND Grad or multiple exposures/HDR in PS. I want to thank all of you who voted for this picture. I will be careful of this rule in my next entry.ThanksAmit PS: If I read the basic editing rule correctly, even if I had used the ND Grad, it would have been DQ''d? Is this understanding correct?', '2006-06-21 03:57:05.000000', '2006-06-21 04:02:31.000000', 0),
