(2535093, 347415, 52957, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for voting !! I am sorry to see this picture has done so badly on this competition and feel sad that some of you voters who have given me 1 and 2 aren''t able to comment on it. I see that maybe the image I have chosen is too much for those who are used to frame ladybirds and flowers, but I hope that this site will keep its appeal and that in the future a photo gets rated on its quality and not whether it is a naked man or a woman. I think we should all be open-minded and rate fairly. In my history I have very rarely given out 1 or 2 points for pictures unless there are really really bad quality and dead boring. I think we all know what I am talking about.</td>', 'Thank you all for voting !! I am sorry to see this picture has done so badly on this competition and feel sad that some of you voters who have given me 1 and 2 aren''t able to comment on it. I see that maybe the image I have chosen is too much for those who are used to frame ladybirds and flowers, but I hope that this site will keep its appeal and that in the future a photo gets rated on its quality and not whether it is a naked man or a woman. I think we should all be open-minded and rate fairly. In my history I have very rarely given out 1 or 2 points for pictures unless there are really really bad quality and dead boring. I think we all know what I am talking about.', '2006-06-21 04:55:05.000000', NULL, 0),
