(2535256, 346540, 60165, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your votes, and constructive criticism.<br/> <br/>The frame is about 3 foot away, whilst the object is half a mile or so, so this is as sharp as I could make the frame. I was in doubt as to whether something round (loops in the fence of the Bund in Shanghai) could be a frame (since it is round, not square), but after having seen all the other entries, I feel this is an OK frame :-)<br/> <br/>A personal high for me, since the shadow one was desparate, just as desolation II is, but Bokeh II will beat this one by a small margin!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you all for your votes, and constructive criticism. The frame is about 3 foot away, whilst the object is half a mile or so, so this is as sharp as I could make the frame. I was in doubt as to whether something round (loops in the fence of the Bund in Shanghai) could be a frame (since it is round, not square), but after having seen all the other entries, I feel this is an OK frame :-) A personal high for me, since the shadow one was desparate, just as desolation II is, but Bokeh II will beat this one by a small margin! ', '2006-06-21 06:37:43.000000', NULL, 0),
