(2535414, 347453, 50674, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a new PB - well done. This is truly a good one. I expect that a lot of people might have gone overboard with the colours; these subtle colours are as they should be. I browsed through the comments and saw that someone had commented on the cropping. I am not good in that department - should sometimes crop a bit more. I have looked at this one from that point of view and I think that if you had cropped, you would have had to crop from the top and the sides, and I am not sure that would have been a better shot. The composition is good, as is.<br/>And after that DQ, you are in 14th place (just like me) :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-21 14:21:40.</i></td>', 'Congrats on a new PB - well done. This is truly a good one. I expect that a lot of people might have gone overboard with the colours; these subtle colours are as they should be. I browsed through the comments and saw that someone had commented on the cropping. I am not good in that department - should sometimes crop a bit more. I have looked at this one from that point of view and I think that if you had cropped, you would have had to crop from the top and the sides, and I am not sure that would have been a better shot. The composition is good, as is.And after that DQ, you are in 14th place (just like me) :)', '2006-06-21 08:38:46.000000', '2006-06-21 15:21:40.000000', 0),
(2535465, 346891, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hehe, this place seems to be to you americans what northern lights are to us Icelanders, almost a guaranteed ribbon or top 10 shot!  Love that location so I am not at all surprised, I definately want to go there someday, for now I am just glad people like you are able to capture the beauty there for those of us that aren´t able to go there ourselves.  Nice work!</td>', 'Hehe, this place seems to be to you americans what northern lights are to us Icelanders, almost a guaranteed ribbon or top 10 shot!  Love that location so I am not at all surprised, I definately want to go there someday, for now I am just glad people like you are able to capture the beauty there for those of us that aren´t able to go there ourselves.  Nice work!', '2006-06-21 08:56:36.000000', NULL, 0),
