(2536671, 347541, 45790, '<td valign="top">Because of the high contrast between the exterior and interior, you should try this with fill flash or other means of brightening the interior, OR shoot at a different time (dawn/dusk) or overcast day, OR (not for the challenge though) try a composite shot exposing for the exterior and interior separately.<br/></td>', 'Because of the high contrast between the exterior and interior, you should try this with fill flash or other means of brightening the interior, OR shoot at a different time (dawn/dusk) or overcast day, OR (not for the challenge though) try a composite shot exposing for the exterior and interior separately.', '2006-06-21 13:32:32.000000', NULL, 0),
