(2537203, 347416, 60396, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all your comments.  I really appreciate any help given.  I have recently finished a degree and as a birthday/finishing pressie hubby kitted me out with some fantastic photographic equipment.  I just have to learn how to use it all.  Although I''ve been a keen photographer most of my life it is only in the last month or so that I have begun to take it particularly seriously.  This is my first challenge and I am looking forward to becoming an active participant on DPC.<br/> <br/>Thanks again</td>', 'Thank you for all your comments.  I really appreciate any help given.  I have recently finished a degree and as a birthday/finishing pressie hubby kitted me out with some fantastic photographic equipment.  I just have to learn how to use it all.  Although I''ve been a keen photographer most of my life it is only in the last month or so that I have begun to take it particularly seriously.  This is my first challenge and I am looking forward to becoming an active participant on DPC. Thanks again', '2006-06-21 16:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2537216, 346748, 25577, '<td valign="top">-Thank you for the comments &amp; votes.  I received multiple "Whish I Was There" comments. Pink Floyd said it best "Wish You Were Here" Imagine an Island full of DPC''ers. For those who wished this picture wasn''t obstructed by bars, wish no more.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=351238" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25577/thumb/351238.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25577/thumb/351238.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25577/thumb/351238.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-21 15:24:09.</i></td>', '-Thank you for the comments & votes.  I received multiple "Whish I Was There" comments. Pink Floyd said it best "Wish You Were Here" Imagine an Island full of DPC''ers. For those who wished this picture wasn''t obstructed by bars, wish no more.', '2006-06-21 16:23:11.000000', '2006-06-21 16:24:09.000000', 0),
