(2538849, 346891, 19708, '<td valign="top">As many times as I see these canyon shots, I''m left in awe.<br/>Congrats on your <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib1.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib1.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib1.gif"/> ribbon Arpita - it''s a beauty!</td>', 'As many times as I see these canyon shots, I''m left in awe.Congrats on your  ribbon Arpita - it''s a beauty!', '2006-06-21 23:09:32.000000', NULL, 0),
