(2540017, 347588, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: WOW, stunning shot. <br/><b>Composition</b>: impressive, the framing is quite original and centers the focus on your mouth.<br/><b>Subject</b>: perfect for the challenge<br/><b>Technical</b>: great: lighting, textures, colors, focus. Everything.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: not sure about anything could improve it. Just a suggestion, have you tried it in B&amp;W?<br/><b>Summary</b>: Congrats on your new PB and top 20. I can feel how you''re growing as a photographer week by week.<br/> <br/>Álex<br/> <br/>EDIT: spelling<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-22 05:48:15.</i></td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: WOW, stunning shot. Composition: impressive, the framing is quite original and centers the focus on your mouth.Subject: perfect for the challengeTechnical: great: lighting, textures, colors, focus. Everything.Improvement: not sure about anything could improve it. Just a suggestion, have you tried it in B&W?Summary: Congrats on your new PB and top 20. I can feel how you''re growing as a photographer week by week. Álex EDIT: spelling', '2006-06-22 06:47:36.000000', '2006-06-22 06:48:15.000000', 0),
