(2540796, 344689, 42916, '<td valign="top">"Oh, couldn''t you find a better frame. The subject is very good but I hate the overexposed left side."<br/> <br/>apparantly I did find a better frame, than you by far. You should mind your comments when your own job is clearly lacking in the same subject of critisism that you project to others. 32nd -&gt; 131st. I do like alot of your other photos in your portfolio though.</td>', '"Oh, couldn''t you find a better frame. The subject is very good but I hate the overexposed left side." apparantly I did find a better frame, than you by far. You should mind your comments when your own job is clearly lacking in the same subject of critisism that you project to others. 32nd -> 131st. I do like alot of your other photos in your portfolio though.', '2006-06-22 12:06:05.000000', NULL, 0),
