(2541244, 346401, 11854, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nards656:</b></div><hr/><i> ==Trading Post==<br/> <br/>Ooh, definitely well framed.  Maybe a hair too wide on the framing, and the flash was definitely not being friendly.  I think a tighter crop would have been stronger. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually there was no flash used on this picture. They have very bright spotlights there that shine on the tree. It''s supposed to look petrified.</td>', 'Originally posted by nards656: ==Trading Post== Ooh, definitely well framed.  Maybe a hair too wide on the framing, and the flash was definitely not being friendly.  I think a tighter crop would have been stronger.   Actually there was no flash used on this picture. They have very bright spotlights there that shine on the tree. It''s supposed to look petrified.', '2006-06-22 14:31:30.000000', NULL, 0),
