(2543503, 345916, 27164, '<td valign="top">I like the idea for this, I just think that you should have included more "framed" area and less frame.  As it is now, the frame is too overpowering and dominates the composition a bit too much.  I also don''t like the bits of orange/brown in the "frame" (granite?)</td>', 'I like the idea for this, I just think that you should have included more "framed" area and less frame.  As it is now, the frame is too overpowering and dominates the composition a bit too much.  I also don''t like the bits of orange/brown in the "frame" (granite?)', '2006-06-23 01:58:06.000000', NULL, 0),
