(2545031, 346091, 60995, '<td valign="top">This photo is one of my favorites that I''ve seen on this website so far, both in composition and subject matter.  I love the cold, brushed texture of the steel in contrast to the live, wrinkled faces of the dogs.  Amazing that they all have the exact same expression--only renforces that they are partners, focused, ready to go (they don''t look sad to me at all).  This photo makes me want to be there and see what happens next.  Love it!</td>', 'This photo is one of my favorites that I''ve seen on this website so far, both in composition and subject matter.  I love the cold, brushed texture of the steel in contrast to the live, wrinkled faces of the dogs.  Amazing that they all have the exact same expression--only renforces that they are partners, focused, ready to go (they don''t look sad to me at all).  This photo makes me want to be there and see what happens next.  Love it!', '2006-06-23 13:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
