(2546969, 347483, 16912, '<td valign="top">Coming from my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=336521&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">1-4-0</a>  thread ...<br/> <br/>Of the 3 shots I''ve commented on this one puzzles me the most! <br/> <br/>After a second take I understand the (subtle) framing but feel the dandelion would have been better if you utilised the rule of thirds more? another thing not mentioned by previous commenters is that although the bokeh is fine there is a lot of digital noise in this shot. The colours are very special here :)</td>', 'Coming from my 1-4-0  thread ... Of the 3 shots I''ve commented on this one puzzles me the most!  After a second take I understand the (subtle) framing but feel the dandelion would have been better if you utilised the rule of thirds more? another thing not mentioned by previous commenters is that although the bokeh is fine there is a lot of digital noise in this shot. The colours are very special here :)', '2006-06-23 22:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
