(2631048, 346148, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like this instance of framing a lot but I feel that there is a bit much to take in, with the foreground and background competing for my attention.  I would have prefered to have the edges of the square of the metal to be parallel with the crop of the picture, because the slanted lines are one more thing for my attention to be drawn to.  However, the colors are good and I like the composition (where the monument is relative to the metal figures).  Very interesting choice of subject and although busy, I do like this photo.</td>', 'I like this instance of framing a lot but I feel that there is a bit much to take in, with the foreground and background competing for my attention.  I would have prefered to have the edges of the square of the metal to be parallel with the crop of the picture, because the slanted lines are one more thing for my attention to be drawn to.  However, the colors are good and I like the composition (where the monument is relative to the metal figures).  Very interesting choice of subject and although busy, I do like this photo.', '2006-07-17 20:31:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2631959, 346812, 40106, '<td valign="top">you like those early shoots don''t ya!! :)  a very crisp shot! that''s amazing with the rain falling in the background!!  before seeing this shot i''ve always dreamed of going to australlia... this shot has definitely inspired me to make that dream a reality.... sooooooon i hope!!!</td>', 'you like those early shoots don''t ya!! :)  a very crisp shot! that''s amazing with the rain falling in the background!!  before seeing this shot i''ve always dreamed of going to australlia... this shot has definitely inspired me to make that dream a reality.... sooooooon i hope!!!', '2006-07-18 02:01:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2640549, 346744, 17148, '<td valign="top">I think you had a good idea herefew things jump out at me that could help you improve upon this image. First keep the background the sameI kinda like the all black looklike on the right hand side. Also looks as if the lighting might be a bit harshas you can see on the front edge of the potbright white standing outthose are your highlights getting blown, but that is easily fixed. Just shoot a bit faster of a shutter speed. With just those two things I think you will see a different shotbut still in line with your idea for the shotOh and Welcome to the sitegreat place to learn even for people who just want to have fun. <br/> <br/>Clint<br/></td>', 'I think you had a good idea herefew things jump out at me that could help you improve upon this image. First keep the background the sameI kinda like the all black looklike on the right hand side. Also looks as if the lighting might be a bit harshas you can see on the front edge of the potbright white standing outthose are your highlights getting blown, but that is easily fixed. Just shoot a bit faster of a shutter speed. With just those two things I think you will see a different shotbut still in line with your idea for the shotOh and Welcome to the sitegreat place to learn even for people who just want to have fun.  Clint', '2006-07-19 23:50:49.000000', NULL, 0),
