(2891934, 346091, 48204, '<td valign="top">I was just looking over my favorites and relized I did not comment on this during the challange. I gave you a 10. I have seen this same image a hundred times and have a dog box in the back of my truck right now and never took the picture. I would hang this on my wall. Perfect in every way, GREAT PHOTO!!!</td>', 'I was just looking over my favorites and relized I did not comment on this during the challange. I gave you a 10. I have seen this same image a hundred times and have a dog box in the back of my truck right now and never took the picture. I would hang this on my wall. Perfect in every way, GREAT PHOTO!!!', '2006-10-03 17:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
