(3008376, 346152, 34659, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice leading lines.  I think you did a nice job with the color tones too.  Focus is pretty good, although it''s not quite tack sharp.  I like the image, but it seems to be missing that "wow" factor that would really win me over.  Cute title though.  :-)</td>', 'Good idea and nice leading lines.  I think you did a nice job with the color tones too.  Focus is pretty good, although it''s not quite tack sharp.  I like the image, but it seems to be missing that "wow" factor that would really win me over.  Cute title though.  :-)', '2006-11-06 21:34:31.000000', NULL, 0),
